WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Ask Codex to help with the failing test already on your screen.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Codex reads the shared terminal and asks to work in it.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:28.000
The agent fixes the discount calculation and runs the tests.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:39.000
Take back input control. Add a test: a discount must never make the price negative.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:52.000
Codex reads your new test, updates the fix, and checks all three cases.

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:58.000
Revisit commands, handoffs, and the requests behind them.

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:02.000
Your agent. One shared terminal.
Real Codex CLI + Conn · Human role automated · Pauses shortened
